---
// HowItWorks.astro - 3-step intuitive guide matching fontfinderai.com style
---

<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-12">
    <div class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wide text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#111111] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] mb-3">
      HOW IT WORKS
    </div>
    <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] text-balance">
      Three Steps to Download Any Scribd Document
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] max-w-xl mx-auto mt-2 text-balance leading-relaxed">
      No software installation, no browser extensions, and no credit card required.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-6">
    <!-- Step 1 -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] bg-white dark:bg-[#111111] p-6 relative transition-colors shadow-2xs">
      <div class="font-mono text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#888888] dark:text-[#757575] mb-3">
        01
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] mb-2">
        Find or copy URL
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Open any document, book, or slide deck on Scribd and copy the link from your browser address bar.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#888888] dark:text-[#757575] truncate">
        scribd.com/document/593847291/...
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2 -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] bg-white dark:bg-[#111111] p-6 relative transition-colors shadow-2xs">
      <div class="font-mono text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#888888] dark:text-[#757575] mb-3">
        02
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] mb-2">
        Paste into SaveScribd
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Paste the link in the box above, or simply change <code class="font-mono text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed]">scribd.com</code> to <code class="font-mono text-[#0070f3]">savescribd.com</code> in your URL bar.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#1a1a1a] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-[11px] font-mono text-[#0070f3] truncate font-medium">
        savescribd.com/document/593847291/...
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3 -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] bg-white dark:bg-[#111111] p-6 relative transition-colors shadow-2xs">
      <div class="font-mono text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#888888] dark:text-[#757575] mb-3">
        03
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-[#ededed] mb-2">
        Save file instantly
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Our parser retrieves the original vector pages and compiles your high-resolution PDF or editable PPT file immediately.
      </p>
      <div class="p-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50/70 dark:bg-emerald-950/40 border border-emerald-200/60 dark:border-emerald-900/40 text-[11px] font-mono text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300 truncate font-semibold">
        ✓ PDF Ready in 1.8 seconds
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
